OL,3,GNEWSAPC thought murderer was making
OL,4,A'empty threats' before arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer called to the home of
OL,7,Fa mother and four children hours before
OL,8,Fthey were murdered in an arson attack
OL,9,Fhas told an inquest she thought the
OL,10,Fkiller was making "empty threats".
OL,12,FPC Gemma Quinn told Bolton Coroner's
OL,13,FCourt she did not think it necessary to
OL,14,Farrest Zak Bolland "there and then"
OL,15,Fafter Michelle Pearson made a 999 call
OL,16,Fsaying the 26-year-old had threatened
OL,17,Fher son and her home on Jackson Street
OL,18,Fin Walkden, Salford.
