OL,3,GNEWSAPC thought murderer was making
OL,4,A'empty threats' before arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour of Michelle's children were
OL,7,Fmurdered in the arson attack on 11
OL,8,FDecember 2017. Michelle, 37, died in
OL,9,FAugust 2019, after being badly burned.
OL,11,FQuinn, a Greater Manchester Police
OL,12,F(GMP) officer of 14 years, told the
OL,13,Fcourt she planned to arrest Bolland
OL,14,Fwhen she was next on shift two days
OL,15,Flater.
